title: 'pallet-multi-asset-bounties: refund only remaining parent value'
doc:
  - audience: [Runtime Dev, Runtime User]
    description: |
      Net parent-bounty refunds against settled child-bounty allocations so
      closing a parent cannot refund value that has already left its escrow.
      No storage migration is required.
crates:
  - name: pallet-multi-asset-bounties
    bump: patch
